{
  "title": "Added hook useCartTotals to the cart page",
  "context": [
    "A shopper who opens the cart now sees a heading above the list of items. The heading gives the number of items and their total price, such as \"2 items for $24.00\". Before this change the page had no heading, and the total was only below the list.",
    "",
    "## Overview",
    "",
    "- **When** a shopper opens the cart page with two items that cost $24.00 in total, **then** [the heading reads \"2 items for $24.00\"](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#L13-15).",
    "- **When** a shopper opens the cart page with one item that costs $12.00, **then** [the heading reads \"1 item for $12.00\"](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#L13-15).",
    "- **When** a shopper removes one of two items on the cart page, **then** [the heading shows the count and the total of the item that is left](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#L9).",
    "- **When** a shopper opens the cart page with no items in the cart, **then** nothing changes: the page shows \"Your cart is empty.\" and no heading.",
    "- **When** a shopper reads the total below the list, **then** nothing changes: the summary still shows \"Total:\" and the price.",
    "",
    "## Implementation",
    "",
    "**`src/hooks/use-cart-totals.ts`**",
    "",
    "- Added [the import of `useCartStore`, `selectItemCount` and `selectTotalCents`](code:src/hooks/use-cart-totals.ts#L1) from `@/stores/cart-store`.",
    "- Added [`useCartTotals()`](code:src/hooks/use-cart-totals.ts#useCartTotals), an exported hook that [reads `itemCount` with `useCartStore(selectItemCount)`](code:src/hooks/use-cart-totals.ts#L4), [reads `totalCents` with `useCartStore(selectTotalCents)`](code:src/hooks/use-cart-totals.ts#L5) and [returns `{ itemCount, totalCents }`](code:src/hooks/use-cart-totals.ts#L6).",
    "",
    "**`src/routes/cart/index.tsx`**",
    "",
    "- Added [the imports of `useCartTotals`, `formatPrice` and `formatQuantity`](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#L1-2).",
    "- Modified [`<CartPage />`](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#CartPage) to [call `useCartTotals()`](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#L9) and to [render an `<h1>` with `formatQuantity(itemCount)` and `formatPrice(totalCents)`](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#L13-15) above the `<ul>` of the items."
  ],
  "diff": [
    "diff --git a/src/hooks/use-cart-totals.ts b/src/hooks/use-cart-totals.ts",
    "new file mode 100644",
    "--- /dev/null",
    "+++ b/src/hooks/use-cart-totals.ts",
    "@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@",
    "+import { selectItemCount, selectTotalCents, useCartStore } from \"@/stores/cart-store\"",
    "+",
    "+export function useCartTotals() {",
    "+  const itemCount = useCartStore(selectItemCount)",
    "+  const totalCents = useCartStore(selectTotalCents)",
    "+  return { itemCount, totalCents }",
    "+}",
    "diff --git a/src/routes/cart/index.tsx b/src/routes/cart/index.tsx",
    "--- a/src/routes/cart/index.tsx",
    "+++ b/src/routes/cart/index.tsx",
    "@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@",
    "+import { useCartTotals } from \"@/hooks/use-cart-totals\"",
    "+import { formatPrice, formatQuantity } from \"@/lib/format\"",
    "@@ -6,0 +9 @@ export function CartPage() {",
    "+  const { itemCount, totalCents } = useCartTotals()",
    "@@ -9,0 +13,3 @@ export function CartPage() {",
    "+      <h1>",
    "+        {formatQuantity(itemCount)} for {formatPrice(totalCents)}",
    "+      </h1>"
  ],
